WEBVTT

00:08.862 --> 00:10.000
Are you ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.103 --> 00:11.896
Aye, aye, Captain!
是啊是啊，队长！

00:12.000 --> 00:13.310
I can't hear you.
我听不到你说话。

00:13.413 --> 00:15.068
Aye, aye, Captain!
是啊是啊，队长！

00:15.172 --> 00:18.241
♪ Oh...
♪ 哦...

00:18.344 --> 00:20.344
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:20.448 --> 00:22.344
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:22.448 --> 00:24.655
♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he. ♪
♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的。 ♪

00:24.758 --> 00:26.310
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:26.413 --> 00:28.333
♪ If nautical nonsense be
something you wish... ♪
♪ 如果航海方面的废话是
你想要的东西...♪

00:28.379 --> 00:30.034
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:30.137 --> 00:32.344
♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish. ♪
♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通。 ♪

00:32.448 --> 00:34.344
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:34.448 --> 00:36.275
♪ Ready?
SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 准备好了吗？
海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:36.379 --> 00:39.275
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:39.379 --> 00:40.206
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:40.310 --> 00:42.689
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:45.103 --> 00:48.586
Captioning sponsored by THE
U.S. DEPARTMENT OF EDUCATION
字幕由 THE 赞助
美国教育部

00:48.689 --> 00:50.655
and NICKELODEON
和尼克国际儿童频道

01:04.344 --> 01:05.931
Closing time...
关门时间...

01:06.034 --> 01:09.000
the happiest time of the day!
一天中最快乐的时刻！

01:09.103 --> 01:11.862
Closing time...
关门时间...

01:11.965 --> 01:14.275
the saddest time of the day.
一天中最悲伤的时刻。

01:15.896 --> 01:16.965
Huh?
啊？

01:17.862 --> 01:19.379
That's a Krabby Patty.
那是蟹黄饼。

01:19.482 --> 01:20.517
Ew...
呃……

01:20.620 --> 01:22.103
It's cold and hard.
又冷又硬。

01:22.206 --> 01:24.172
This could have rolled
there years ago.
这本来可以滚动
几年前就在那里。

01:24.275 --> 01:28.275
There, there, little one,
your journey is almost over.
那里，那里，小家伙，
你的旅程即将结束。

01:31.068 --> 01:32.068
What happened?!
发生了什么？！

01:33.103 --> 01:35.758
Someone tried to
throw away a patty!
有人试图
扔掉一块肉饼！

01:35.862 --> 01:40.724
Pinch-o-matic has saved you
5.2 cents.
Pinch-o-matic 救了你
5.2 美分。

01:40.827 --> 01:43.896
But, Mr. Krabs, I found that
under the grill.
但是，蟹老板，我发现
在烤架下。

01:44.000 --> 01:46.896
And tomorrow a customer
will find it under his bun.
明天还有一位顾客
会在他的发髻下面找到它。

01:47.000 --> 01:49.827
But... it's old
and it's cold
但是……已经老了
天气很冷

01:49.931 --> 01:51.758
and so very full of mold.
非常霉菌。

01:51.862 --> 01:53.620
You're not to make another Patty
你不能再做一个帕蒂

01:53.724 --> 01:55.068
until that one is sold.
直到那个被卖掉。

01:55.172 --> 01:56.206
Understand?
理解？

01:57.586 --> 01:59.034
Order up, Squidward.
下令吧，章鱼哥。

01:59.137 --> 02:00.758
Hooray.
万岁。

02:03.517 --> 02:05.689
Uh... SpongeBob...
呃……海绵宝宝……

02:05.793 --> 02:07.896
can I get one
with less... fog.
我可以买一个吗
雾气更少。

02:08.000 --> 02:10.931
Sorry, Squidward,
Mr. Krabs's orders.
对不起，章鱼哥，
蟹老板的命令。

02:11.034 --> 02:12.551
Whatever.
任何。

02:12.655 --> 02:14.793
Here you are, sir,
one Krabby Patty.
在这里，先生，
一份蟹肉饼。

02:18.448 --> 02:20.517
I don't understand...
我不明白...

02:20.620 --> 02:22.896
We haven't had
a customer in weeks.
我们没有过
几周内就有一位客户。

02:23.000 --> 02:25.000
I wonder if it's
the new placemats.
我想知道是不是
新餐垫。

02:25.103 --> 02:26.103
What?
什么？

02:27.034 --> 02:27.827
Placemats?
餐垫？

02:27.931 --> 02:29.344
Have you lost your mind?
你失去理智了吗？

02:29.448 --> 02:30.551
It's that old patty
就是那个老肉饼

02:30.655 --> 02:32.517
you keep trying
to sell to everybody!
你继续努力
卖给大家！

02:32.620 --> 02:34.206
It's gone bad.
情况已经很糟糕了。

02:34.310 --> 02:35.551
Gone bad?
变坏了吗？

02:35.655 --> 02:36.551
That's nonsense.
那是无稽之谈。

02:36.655 --> 02:38.137
Bring it here, SpongeBob.
把它带到这里来，海绵宝宝。

02:39.517 --> 02:41.827
Uh... Why is it in a cage?
呃……为什么在笼子里？

02:41.931 --> 02:42.965
Because it growled at me.
因为它对我咆哮。

02:48.034 --> 02:50.517
You two would have never
have lasted in the navy.
你们两个永远不会
一直在海军服役。

02:50.620 --> 02:52.517
Let's see how bad you are.
让我们看看你有多糟糕。

02:55.241 --> 02:56.517
No!
不！

02:56.620 --> 02:57.724
No...
不...

02:59.206 --> 03:00.206
Stay...
停留...

03:02.517 --> 03:03.758
That a girl!
那是个女孩！

03:03.862 --> 03:06.068
There, there.
那里，那里。

03:06.172 --> 03:07.172
See?
看？

03:07.241 --> 03:08.620
Good enough to eat.
吃饱就好了。

03:10.379 --> 03:11.275
Oh.
哦。

03:11.379 --> 03:12.379
Look.
看。

03:12.413 --> 03:14.068
An ambulance.
一辆救护车。

03:14.172 --> 03:15.172
Now, then.
现在，然后。

03:16.793 --> 03:18.413
SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝？

03:18.517 --> 03:20.965
Yes, Mr. Krabs?
是吗，蟹老板？

03:21.068 --> 03:23.517
Make sure you wrap up
that patty...
确保你包好
那个小馅饼...

03:23.620 --> 03:27.137
I'm not finished with it yet!
我还没说完呢！

03:28.103 --> 03:31.448
Well, Mr. Krabs,
you gave us quite a scare.
好吧，蟹老板先生，
你把我们吓坏了。

03:31.551 --> 03:32.931
So I'm going to be okay, doc?
所以我会没事的，博士？

03:33.034 --> 03:35.586
Well, if you don't want
to take my word for it,
好吧，如果你不想
相信我的话，

03:35.689 --> 03:37.413
let's just check your chart.
让我们检查一下你的图表。

03:37.517 --> 03:39.379
Let's see here.
让我们看看这里。

03:39.482 --> 03:41.000
Hmm.
唔。

03:41.103 --> 03:42.586
Oh, no.
哦，不。

03:42.689 --> 03:43.862
Oh, no!
哦，不！

03:43.965 --> 03:45.482
This is terrible!
这太可怕了！

03:45.586 --> 03:46.724
Everything okay, doc?
一切都好吗，医生？

03:46.827 --> 03:48.103
Don't touch me!
别碰我！

03:49.344 --> 03:51.310
That's not a good sign.
这不是一个好兆头。

03:54.551 --> 03:56.965
Oh, no, it's
the Flying Dutchman!
哦，不，这是
飞翔的荷兰人号！

03:57.068 --> 04:02.344
Eugene Krabs,
your time has come.
尤金·克拉布斯，
你的时刻到了。

04:02.448 --> 04:06.482
I'm not Eugene Krabs,
I'm, uh, Harold!
我不是尤金·克拉布斯
我是，呃，哈罗德！

04:06.586 --> 04:09.137
Harold, uh... Flower!
哈罗德，呃……花！

04:09.241 --> 04:10.034
Oh, sorry.
哦，抱歉。

04:10.137 --> 04:11.896
I must have the wrong room.
我一定是走错房间了。

04:12.000 --> 04:13.758
Excuse me, nurse?
对不起，护士？

04:13.862 --> 04:15.000
Yes?
是的？

04:15.103 --> 04:17.172
I'm looking for Eugene Krabs.
我在找尤金·克拉布斯。

04:17.275 --> 04:19.724
Oh, he's in that room,
right there.
哦，他在那个房间里，
就在那里。

04:19.827 --> 04:22.344
No, that's Harold Flower's room.
不，那是哈罗德·弗劳尔的房间。

04:22.448 --> 04:23.586
Harold Flower?
哈罗德·弗劳尔？

04:23.689 --> 04:25.793
So, Krabs!
所以，蟹蟹们！

04:25.896 --> 04:28.068
You thought you could fool
the Flying Dutchman?
你以为你可以愚弄
飞翔的荷兰人号？

04:28.172 --> 04:30.206
What do you want from me?
你想从我处得到些什么？

04:30.310 --> 04:33.137
I'm here to escort you
to the resting place
我是来护送你的
到休息的地方

04:33.241 --> 04:36.931
of all bad undersea folk...
所有坏的海底人……

04:37.034 --> 04:39.931
Davy Jones's locker!
戴维·琼斯的储物柜！

04:40.034 --> 04:41.965
Davy Jones's locker?
戴维·琼斯的储物柜？

04:42.068 --> 04:43.793
Why do I have to go there?
为什么我必须去那里？

04:43.896 --> 04:44.965
I'm not a bad crab!
我不是一只坏螃蟹！

04:45.068 --> 04:48.000
Ah, but you were cheap,
啊，但你很便宜，

04:48.103 --> 04:50.965
and being cheap is
a terrible thing.
便宜是
一件可怕的事情。

04:51.068 --> 04:54.689
Next stop... Davy Jones's locker!
下一站...戴维·琼斯的储物柜！

04:59.344 --> 05:01.206
Here we are!
我们到了！

05:02.896 --> 05:04.172
Blech!
布莱赫！

05:04.275 --> 05:05.862
Why does it smell so foul?
为什么闻起来这么臭？

05:05.965 --> 05:08.448
Davy Jones works out a lot.
戴维琼斯经常锻炼。

05:08.551 --> 05:10.241
These are his socks.
这是他的袜子。

05:10.344 --> 05:11.482
Get in!
进来！

05:13.758 --> 05:16.068
Oh, please, Mr. Dutchman,
哦，拜托，达奇曼先生，

05:16.172 --> 05:19.482
I don't want to go in there!
我不想进去！

05:19.586 --> 05:21.137
I'll do anything!
我什么都会做！

05:21.241 --> 05:24.206
Please, give me another chance!
请再给我一次机会！

05:24.310 --> 05:25.724
Come on, Krabs,
来吧，蟹蟹们

05:25.827 --> 05:27.689
show a little dignity.
表现出一点尊严。

05:27.793 --> 05:30.068
Mommy!
妈妈！

05:30.172 --> 05:33.620
All right, all right,
stop your crying.
好吧，好吧，
别哭了。

05:33.724 --> 05:35.172
I'll give you another chance.
我再给你一次机会。

05:35.275 --> 05:38.241
But you must always
be generous...
但你必须始终
慷慨一点……

05:38.344 --> 05:39.827
Nevercheap.
绝不便宜。

05:39.931 --> 05:42.275
You have my word as a sailor.
作为一名水手，我向你保证。

05:45.172 --> 05:47.965
Mr. Krabs'
nosehair clippers.
蟹老板的
鼻毛剪。

05:48.068 --> 05:49.103
I could use these.
我可以用这些。

05:49.206 --> 05:51.172
Squidward, you
shouldn't be going
章鱼哥你
不应该去

05:51.275 --> 05:53.068
through Mr. Krabs'
belongings.
通过蟹老板的
财物。

05:53.172 --> 05:55.379
He won't like it!
他不会喜欢的！

05:55.482 --> 05:59.137
SpongeBob, I told you
what the doctor said:
海绵宝宝，我告诉过你了
医生说：

05:59.241 --> 06:00.655
Mr. Krabs isn't coming back.
蟹老板不会回来了。

06:00.758 --> 06:03.793
Now, keep quiet so I can hear
the tumblers in his safe.
现在，保持安静，这样我就能听到
他保险箱里的玻璃杯。

06:03.896 --> 06:04.896
Hey, boys!
嘿，孩子们！

06:05.931 --> 06:07.931
Mr. Krabs, I knew it!
蟹老板，我就知道！

06:08.034 --> 06:09.103
You're alive!
你还活着！

06:09.206 --> 06:12.137
Squidward, look,
it's Mr. Krabs!
章鱼哥，你看，
是蟹老板！

06:12.241 --> 06:13.896
Isn't this too good to be true?
这不是好得令人难以置信吗？

06:14.000 --> 06:15.551
Well, it was.
嗯，确实如此。

06:15.655 --> 06:16.758
You know, boys,
你知道，孩子们，

06:16.862 --> 06:18.413
being sick made me think a lot.
生病让我想了很多。

06:18.517 --> 06:21.068
My whole life has been
about money...
我的一生都是
关于钱...

06:21.172 --> 06:26.724
Saving money, collecting money,
touching money.
省钱、收钱、
接触金钱。

06:26.827 --> 06:28.275
Well, you get the picture.
好吧，你明白了。

06:28.379 --> 06:29.689
But no more.
但仅此而已。

06:29.793 --> 06:33.310
You're looking at the new,
improved, non-cheap Mr. Krabs.
你正在看新的，
改进的，不便宜的蟹老板。

06:33.413 --> 06:36.241
Welcome, all, welcome!
欢迎大家，欢迎大家！

06:38.620 --> 06:40.413
Hello, little one.
你好，小家伙。

06:40.517 --> 06:41.551
What you got there?
你在那里得到了什么？

06:41.655 --> 06:42.758
A Krabby Patty.
蟹肉饼。

06:44.517 --> 06:45.862
Of course you do!
当然可以！

06:45.965 --> 06:48.034
You know what that means, right?
你知道这意味着什么，对吗？

06:48.137 --> 06:49.655
I don't go hungry?
我不饿吗？

06:49.758 --> 06:51.000
No, silly!
不，傻瓜！

06:51.103 --> 06:54.448
It means: free toy!
意思是：免费玩具！

06:54.551 --> 06:56.275
Gee, thanks,
Mr. Krabs.
哎呀，谢谢，
蟹老板。

06:56.379 --> 06:58.413
I thought you were
a cheap old tightwad.
我以为你是
一个廉价的老吝啬鬼

06:58.517 --> 07:00.931
I was, son, I was.
我是，儿子，我是。

07:01.034 --> 07:02.758
Free toys for everyone!
为所有人提供免费玩具！

07:02.862 --> 07:04.413
And free refills!
并免费续杯！

07:06.413 --> 07:07.172
Hello, boy.
你好，男孩。

07:07.275 --> 07:08.344
Say, where's Squidward?
说吧，章鱼哥在哪里？

07:08.448 --> 07:10.620
Oh, he's taking one
of those break things
哦，他正在拿一个
那些破坏的东西

07:10.724 --> 07:11.758
in your office...
在你的办公室...

07:11.862 --> 07:13.379
I mean the "employee lounge."
我的意思是“员工休息室”。

07:17.275 --> 07:18.172
Great!
伟大的！

07:18.275 --> 07:20.137
Excuse me, I dropped
my Krabby Patty.
对不起，我掉线了
我的蟹蟹帕蒂。

07:20.241 --> 07:21.275
Could I get another one?
我可以再买一份吗？

07:21.379 --> 07:23.206
SpongeBob? Yes, sir.
海绵宝宝？是的，先生。

07:23.310 --> 07:25.206
"Krusty Krab policy
clearly states
“蟹堡王政策
明确指出

07:25.310 --> 07:27.103
"once the burger has
reached the customer,
“一旦汉堡有
到达客户那里，

07:27.206 --> 07:28.793
it is his/her responsibility."
这是他/她的责任。”

07:28.896 --> 07:30.172
SpongeBob!
海绵宝宝！

07:30.275 --> 07:31.310
That's the old policy.
那是旧政策。

07:31.413 --> 07:33.586
Now run back and
bring out a fresh one.
现在跑回来
拿出一份新鲜的。

07:33.689 --> 07:34.689
Aye, aye, sir!
是啊，是啊，先生！

07:34.758 --> 07:36.551
Sorry about the confusion.
很抱歉造成混乱。

07:36.655 --> 07:37.793
Free toy?
免费玩具？

07:37.896 --> 07:39.379
Eugene, my man.
尤金，我的男人。

07:39.482 --> 07:40.517
Squidward!
章鱼哥！

07:40.620 --> 07:41.965
How's the break coming?
休息时间怎么样？

07:42.068 --> 07:44.068
Should be over in
a couple of hours.
应该结束于
几个小时。

07:44.172 --> 07:45.793
Have SpongeBob send back a patty
让海绵宝宝寄回一块肉饼

07:45.896 --> 07:47.206
and an iced tea, will you?
和一杯冰茶，好吗？

07:47.310 --> 07:48.482
Sure thing, Squidward.
当然可以，章鱼哥。

07:48.586 --> 07:49.620
Take it easy.
别紧张。

07:50.620 --> 07:53.172
Are you enjoying
your in-meal movie?
你享受吗
你的餐中电影？

07:53.275 --> 07:55.965
This movie hasn't even
been in the theaters yet!
这部电影甚至还没有
已经在影院上映了！

07:56.068 --> 07:59.379
No expense spared for
my valued customers.
不遗余力
我尊贵的客户。

07:59.482 --> 08:02.310
Look at all those happy faces.
看看那些幸福的面孔。

08:02.413 --> 08:04.655
It sure does feel good
to be generous.
确实感觉不错
要慷慨。

08:04.758 --> 08:06.206
Here's your mail, Eugene.
这是你的邮件，尤金。

08:06.310 --> 08:07.793
Thanks, Squidward.
谢谢，章鱼哥。

08:07.896 --> 08:09.172
You look rested.
你看起来很休息。

08:09.275 --> 08:12.931
Yeah, these naps at work
are doing wonders for me.
是的，这些工作中的小睡
正在为我创造奇迹。

08:13.034 --> 08:14.206
Credit card bills.
信用卡账单。

08:14.310 --> 08:16.000
Well, I knew this was coming.
嗯，我知道这会到来。

08:16.103 --> 08:17.379
Let's see what the damage is.
我们来看看有什么伤害。

08:17.482 --> 08:20.965
Only $10,000...
That's not so bad.
只需要 10,000 美元...
那还不错。

08:21.068 --> 08:23.275
I'll just subtract it
from today's profit.
我就减去它
从今天的利润来看。

08:24.862 --> 08:27.482
And... there's no money in here.
而且……这里没有钱。

08:29.172 --> 08:30.482
How delightful!
多么令人愉快啊！

08:30.586 --> 08:33.068
Squidward, I'm worried
about Mr. Krabs.
章鱼哥，我很担心
关于蟹老板。

08:33.172 --> 08:35.241
Me, too... how are we
going to get paid?
我也是……我们怎么样
会得到报酬吗？

08:35.344 --> 08:39.586
Gee, Mr. Krabs, you sure are
taking total bankruptcy well.
哎呀，蟹老板，你确实是
彻底破产。

08:39.689 --> 08:41.827
Oh, it's just a bad dream.
哦，这只是一个噩梦。

08:41.931 --> 08:42.931
I'll wake up soon.
我很快就会醒来。

08:45.517 --> 08:46.379
Uh, "dream"?
呃，“梦”？

08:46.482 --> 08:47.620
Sure.
当然。

08:47.724 --> 08:49.000
I'm still in the hospital
我还在医院

08:49.103 --> 08:50.379
sleeping like a baby!
睡得像个婴儿！

08:50.482 --> 08:53.103
Um, you checked out of
the hospital this morning.
嗯，你签出了
今天早上去医院。

08:53.206 --> 08:54.103
Here's the bill.
这是账单。

08:54.206 --> 08:57.206
You mean... I'm awake?!
你的意思是……我醒了？！

09:04.586 --> 09:05.586
No more refills!
不再需要补充！

09:08.068 --> 09:10.896
Give me back them toys,
you freeloaders!
把玩具还给我，
你们这些贪图便宜的人！

09:11.000 --> 09:13.241
Show's over, cheapskate!
演出结束了，小气鬼！

09:18.379 --> 09:20.655
Hey, it's my lucky day...
嘿，今天是我的幸运日...

09:20.758 --> 09:21.655
A penny!
一分钱！

09:21.758 --> 09:24.034
Your luck just ran out!
你的运气刚刚耗尽！

09:24.137 --> 09:25.344
Hey, man, ease back,
嘿，伙计，放松点，

09:25.448 --> 09:26.517
you're crushing my arm.
你压断了我的手臂。

09:26.620 --> 09:29.310
Unhand that penny
or the arm comes off.
松开那一分钱
或者手臂脱落。

09:31.965 --> 09:33.413
Ah-hah!
啊哈！

09:33.517 --> 09:36.482
That little display of
parsimonious penny pinching
那个小展示
吝啬的一分钱

09:36.586 --> 09:40.241
just earned you a nice little
spot in Davy Jones's locker...
刚刚为你赢得了一点点
戴维·琼斯的储物柜里……

09:40.344 --> 09:42.206
for eternity!
为了永恒！

09:42.310 --> 09:44.379
I'm not cheap, I'm generous!
我不是贪小便宜，我是大方！

09:44.482 --> 09:47.241
You almost tore
a man's arm off
for a penny.
你差点撕破
一个男人的手臂被砍掉
一分钱。

09:47.344 --> 09:50.172
Thanks, Squidward,
I knew I could count on you.
谢谢，章鱼哥，
我知道我可以依靠你。

09:50.275 --> 09:52.931
Well, a deal's a deal.
好吧，成交就是成交。

09:53.034 --> 09:54.068
Let's go.
我们走吧。

09:54.172 --> 09:56.620
Wait just a
burger-flipping second.
等一个
翻转汉堡第二。

09:56.724 --> 10:00.482
Who dares back-sass
the Flying Dutchman?
谁还敢顶嘴
飞翔的荷兰人号？

10:00.586 --> 10:04.758
That would be me:
SpongeBob Back-sass Pants.
那就是我：
海绵宝宝背带裤。

10:04.862 --> 10:06.896
I say you got the wrong crab.
我说你吃错螃蟹了。

10:07.000 --> 10:09.517
This Mr. Krabs is
the most generous,
这位蟹老板是
最慷慨的，

10:09.620 --> 10:13.344
big-hearted,
non-skinflinted crab
in the whole sea.
心胸宽广，
无皮蟹
在整个大海中。

10:13.448 --> 10:17.172
He'd sell your soul
for a couple of bucks.
他会出卖你的灵魂
几块钱。

10:17.275 --> 10:19.793
I'd bet my soul he wouldn't.
我敢打赌他不会。

10:19.896 --> 10:21.172
You got yourself a bet.
你给自己下了一个赌注。

10:21.275 --> 10:23.827
Okay, Krabs, I'll let you stay,
好吧，蟹蟹，我让你留下来，

10:23.931 --> 10:26.379
but first help me settle a bet.
不过先帮我打个赌吧。

10:26.482 --> 10:29.517
If you had to choose
between SpongeBob
如果你必须选择
海绵宝宝之间

10:29.620 --> 10:33.482
and all the money in my pocket,
which would you take?
还有我口袋里所有的钱
你会选择哪个？

10:33.586 --> 10:35.034
That depends... how much money
那要看多少钱

10:35.137 --> 10:36.137
we talking about?
我们在谈论什么？

10:36.206 --> 10:37.344
Mr. Krabs?
蟹老板？

10:37.448 --> 10:39.344
Sixty-two cents.
六十二美分。

10:39.448 --> 10:40.448
I'll take the money.
我会拿钱。

10:40.551 --> 10:41.862
Mr. Krabs?!
蟹老板？！

10:41.965 --> 10:43.896
Here you go, Krabs.
给你，蟹蟹。

10:44.000 --> 10:45.896
Sixty-two cents.
六十二美分。

10:46.000 --> 10:49.413
Next stop Davy Jones's locker!
下一站戴维·琼斯的储物柜！

10:53.241 --> 10:54.931
Look, Squidward, money!
看，章鱼哥，钱！

10:55.034 --> 10:57.482
Mr. Krabs, I can't
believe I'm saying this,
蟹老板，我不能
相信我说的是

10:57.586 --> 11:01.586
but how could you trade
SpongeBob for 62 cents?
但你怎么能交易
海绵宝宝 62 美分？

11:01.689 --> 11:03.517
You think I could have
gotten more?
你认为我可以
得到更多？

11:03.620 --> 11:07.172
He stuck up for you
and you sold him out.
他为你挺身而出
而你出卖了他。

11:07.275 --> 11:09.379
You should be ashamed
of yourself!
你应该感到羞耻
你自己！

11:09.482 --> 11:12.379
Oh, what have I done?
哦，我做了什么？

11:12.482 --> 11:14.103
Oh!
哦！

11:14.206 --> 11:15.344
I want another chance!
我还想再有一次机会！

11:15.448 --> 11:17.275
I didn't learn anything!
我什么也没学到！

11:17.379 --> 11:18.896
I lost my best fry cook.
我失去了最好的炒菜厨师。

11:19.000 --> 11:23.551
I don't want this foul money,
I want SpongeBob back!
我不要这些脏钱
我要海绵宝宝回来！

11:26.793 --> 11:27.793
Here, take him back.
来，把他带回去。

11:27.862 --> 11:30.344
You heard what I said
about the money?
你听到我说的话了
关于钱？

11:30.448 --> 11:32.068
Heard what you said?
听到你说的话了吗？

11:32.172 --> 11:35.379
I couldn't hear myself thinking
with this one around.
我听不到自己的思考
有这个在身边。

11:35.482 --> 11:37.482
I only had him for 30 seconds,
我只和他相处了30秒

11:37.586 --> 11:41.379
and it's jellyfishing this
and Mermaidman that.
这是水母
还有美人鱼那个。

11:41.482 --> 11:42.862
What "not giving him back"?
什么“不还他”？

11:42.965 --> 11:45.241
He's a fate worse than death!
他的下场比死还惨！

11:45.344 --> 11:47.344
He's your problem now.
他现在就是你的问题了。

11:51.172 --> 11:53.413
Eh, eh, about trading you
for pocket change...
呃呃关于交易你
用于零钱...

11:53.517 --> 11:56.172
Say no more, Mr. Krabs.
别再说了，蟹老板。

11:56.275 --> 11:57.896
You did it for the Krusty Krab.
你为蟹堡王做的。

11:58.000 --> 11:59.724
I would have done
the same thing.
我会做的
同样的事情。

11:59.827 --> 12:00.827
You would have?
你会吗？

12:00.896 --> 12:01.896
No.
不。

12:10.551 --> 12:11.655
Dutchman's residence.
荷兰人的住所。

12:11.758 --> 12:13.034
So, as I was saying,
所以，正如我所说，

12:13.137 --> 12:15.206
you and me got to hang out more.
你和我必须多出去玩。

12:15.310 --> 12:17.586
Well, what nights
are good for you...
嗯，什么晚上
对你有好处...

12:37.344 --> 12:38.344
Huh?
啊？

12:42.344 --> 12:44.379
Oh, I got dead again.
哦，我又死了。

12:44.482 --> 12:46.103
This game stinks.
这游戏真臭

12:50.413 --> 12:52.241
See, that's why you must always
看吧，这就是为什么你必须始终

12:52.344 --> 12:54.241
pay attention to the mountain.
注意山上。

12:54.344 --> 12:57.344
I'm listening to you, mountain!
我在听你说话，山！

12:57.448 --> 12:59.758
Don't eat
the yellow sand, Patrick.
不要吃
黄沙，帕特里克。

12:59.862 --> 13:01.275
Oh, yeah, I forgot.
哦，是的，我忘了。

13:02.827 --> 13:06.103
Hey, Sandy, watch me do
the "Grouchy Squidward"
嘿，桑迪，看我做
“脾气暴躁的章鱼哥”

13:06.206 --> 13:08.172
Stop naming moves after me!
别再用我的名字命名动作了！

13:08.275 --> 13:11.344
Everybody's an idiot
except for me.
每个人都是白痴
除了我。

13:11.448 --> 13:12.896
Well, it's true.
嗯，这是真的。

13:18.586 --> 13:19.586
SpongeBob!
海绵宝宝！

13:19.689 --> 13:20.931
Look out for that tree!
小心那棵树！

13:21.034 --> 13:22.379
Huh?
啊？

13:23.379 --> 13:26.034
Don't worry,
everything's under control,
别担心，
一切都在掌控之中

13:26.137 --> 13:27.551
'cause I'm an expert...!
因为我是专家......！

13:30.862 --> 13:32.068
Hmm... that's funny,
嗯……这很有趣，

13:32.172 --> 13:34.482
someone turned
the mountain upside-down.
有人转身
山颠倒了。

13:36.758 --> 13:39.896
SpongeBob, land on your bottom!
海绵宝宝，落地吧！

13:40.000 --> 13:42.517
It'll cushion the impact
of the fall!
它将缓冲影响
秋天的！

13:43.793 --> 13:45.000
Like this?
像这样？

13:45.103 --> 13:46.241
No, your other bottom!
不，你的另一个屁股！

13:46.344 --> 13:48.620
Don't you have to be
stupid somewhere else?
你不是一定要这样吗
其他地方傻吗？

13:48.724 --> 13:49.724
Not until four.
直到四点。

13:52.620 --> 13:54.034
Ow, that's got to hurt.
噢，那一定很痛。

13:54.137 --> 13:55.379
Do it again, I wasn't looking!
再做一遍，我没看！

13:59.034 --> 14:01.068
Well, it looks like
your gluteus maximus
嗯，看起来像
你的臀大肌

14:01.172 --> 14:02.517
has made a full recovery.
已完全康复。

14:02.620 --> 14:03.620
My what has a what now?
我的什么现在有什么？

14:03.689 --> 14:04.827
Your butt's all better.
你的屁股好多了。

14:04.931 --> 14:06.413
It's really quite amazing.
这真的是相当惊人。

14:06.517 --> 14:09.275
It took 20 hours
to put it all back together.
花了20个小时
把它们全部重新组合起来。

14:09.379 --> 14:12.482
We actually ran out of staples
and had to use a glue stick.
我们实际上用完了订书钉
并不得不使用胶棒。

14:12.586 --> 14:16.379
Yep, you're a lucky, lucky,
lucky, lucky, lucky, luck-boy.
是的，你很幸运，很幸运，
幸运，幸运，幸运，幸运儿。

14:16.482 --> 14:17.482
But from now on,
但从现在开始，

14:17.551 --> 14:19.344
I'd like you to be more careful.
我希望你更加小心。

14:19.448 --> 14:20.862
One more injury like that
又是一次这样的伤害

14:20.965 --> 14:23.827
and you could wind up
like that poor creature there...
你可能会结束
就像那里那个可怜的生物一样……

14:23.931 --> 14:25.724
In the Iron Butt.
在铁屁股里。

14:25.827 --> 14:29.275
Oh, man, it itches.
哦，伙计，它很痒。

14:30.413 --> 14:32.310
You heard the doctor, SpongeBob,
你听到海绵宝宝医生的话了

14:32.413 --> 14:35.379
one more injury like that
and it's the Iron Butt!
再来一次这样的伤害
这就是铁屁股！

14:35.482 --> 14:37.310
I've been too careless
back there.
我太不小心了
回到那里。

14:37.413 --> 14:40.310
From now on I am on
round-the-clock butt patrol.
从现在开始我就在
全天候巡逻。

14:41.103 --> 14:42.931
Hey, step away from the backside
嘿，从后面走开

14:43.034 --> 14:44.034
I'm warning you.
我警告你。

14:44.068 --> 14:45.206
What's your problem?
你有什么问题吗？

14:45.310 --> 14:46.689
That was close.
那很接近了。

14:46.793 --> 14:48.241
Hey, SpongeBob!
嘿，海绵宝宝！

14:48.344 --> 14:49.517
Why don't you join us?
你为什么不加入我们呢？

14:49.620 --> 14:50.827
We need an extra player.
我们需要一名额外的球员。

14:50.931 --> 14:52.482
Nice catch, Percy!
不错的收获，珀西！

14:53.758 --> 14:54.965
Hey, SpongeBob!
嘿，海绵宝宝！

14:55.068 --> 14:56.379
You've got to try this, dude!
你一定要试试这个，伙计！

14:56.482 --> 14:58.448
We finally got enough people
我们终于有足够的人了

14:58.551 --> 15:01.206
for a seven-mile
spanking machine!
七英里
打屁股机器！

15:02.689 --> 15:04.793
Ouch, ouch, ouch, ow...!
哎哟，哎哟，哎哟，哎哟……！

15:04.896 --> 15:05.896
Next!
下一个！

15:08.275 --> 15:09.758
Is this where the line starts?
这是队伍的起点吗？

15:09.862 --> 15:12.103
My butt is not safe out here!
我的屁股在这里不安全！

15:13.310 --> 15:15.448
No part of me is safe.
我的身体没有一个部分是安全的。

15:16.137 --> 15:17.172
Whoo-hoo!
呼呼！

15:17.275 --> 15:19.620
Yeah, ride 'em, cowboy!
是的，骑上它们吧，牛仔！

15:24.689 --> 15:25.896
Hey, SpongeBob.
嘿，海绵宝宝。

15:31.137 --> 15:32.827
Ooh...
哦...

15:32.931 --> 15:34.137
That was fun.
那很有趣。

15:35.413 --> 15:36.724
Hey, SpongeBob, you ready
嘿，海绵宝宝，你准备好了

15:36.827 --> 15:38.137
to go sand-boarding again?
又去滑沙了吗？

15:38.241 --> 15:39.275
SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝？

15:39.379 --> 15:40.793
Hello, friends.
大家好。

15:40.896 --> 15:43.172
Enjoying the outside world?
享受外面的世界吗？

15:43.275 --> 15:45.724
What y'all doing sitting
in the middle of the floor?
你们坐着做什么
在地板中间？

15:45.827 --> 15:49.206
Oh, living out the remainder
of my life... in safety.
噢，活出剩余的时间
我的生命……安全。

15:49.310 --> 15:51.931
If you guys were smart,
you would join me.
如果你们聪明的话
你会加入我的。

15:52.034 --> 15:53.379
That accident made me realize
那次事故让我意识到

15:53.482 --> 15:55.241
that it's dangerous out there.
外面很危险。

15:55.344 --> 15:56.827
I was one of the lucky ones.
我是幸运者之一。

15:56.931 --> 15:57.793
I'm a survivor.
我是一个幸存者。

15:57.896 --> 15:59.241
And so I've simply decided
所以我决定

15:59.344 --> 16:01.344
I am never leaving
my house again.
我永远不会离开
又是我的房子。

16:01.448 --> 16:02.862
That's crazy talk!
这是疯狂的言论！

16:02.965 --> 16:04.379
That's not crazy talk.
这不是胡言乱语。

16:04.482 --> 16:05.689
Thisis crazy talk.
这是疯狂的言论。

16:11.413 --> 16:12.517
Sorry.
对不起。

16:12.620 --> 16:14.413
No, Patrick's right, Sandy.
不，帕特里克是对的，桑迪。

16:14.517 --> 16:16.137
You saw what happened to me,
你看到了发生在我身上的事

16:16.241 --> 16:18.413
and next time
it won't just be my butt,
下次
这不仅仅是我的屁股

16:18.517 --> 16:20.344
it'll be my armpit
or my forehead.
这将是我的腋窝
或者我的额头。

16:20.448 --> 16:22.137
Or your other armpit!
或者你的另一个腋窝！

16:22.241 --> 16:24.379
I was wrong
to go against nature.
我错了
去违背自然。

16:24.482 --> 16:26.517
I'm a sponge...
What was I thinking?
我是一块海绵...
我在想什么？

16:26.620 --> 16:29.068
Walking... my people
are sedentary.
行走……我的人民
是久坐的。

16:29.172 --> 16:30.551
Just sitting in your house?
就坐在你家吗？

16:30.655 --> 16:32.551
Ain't you going to get lonesome?
你不会变得孤独吗？

16:32.655 --> 16:35.965
I won't be lonesome, I've got
all the friends I need here.
我不会孤单，我有
这里有我需要的所有朋友。

16:36.068 --> 16:37.862
This is Penny.
这是佩妮。

16:37.965 --> 16:39.241
And Chip.
还有奇普。

16:40.000 --> 16:41.793
And say hello to Used Napkin.
并向用过的餐巾打个招呼。

16:41.896 --> 16:44.758
How are you going to keep
your job at the Krusty Krab?
你要如何保留
你在蟹堡王的工作吗？

16:44.862 --> 16:46.689
No problem!
没问题！

16:50.655 --> 16:52.655
A reallylong spatula.
一把很长的抹刀。

16:53.965 --> 16:54.827
What about eating?
吃饭呢？

16:54.931 --> 16:55.931
I'm a sponge!
我是一块海绵！

16:55.965 --> 16:57.275
I'll just filter-feed.
我只会过滤。

17:07.655 --> 17:09.379
SpongeBob, sooner or later
海绵宝宝，迟早会出现

17:09.482 --> 17:11.586
you're going to have
to go outside.
你将会有
到外面去。

17:11.689 --> 17:14.586
Listen, I told you that I'm
never leaving my house again!
听着，我告诉过你我是
再也不会离开我的家了！

17:14.689 --> 17:15.862
Never-ever?
从来没有？

17:15.965 --> 17:17.758
Never-ever-ever.
永远永远。

17:17.862 --> 17:21.206
Never-never-ever-ever
for never-ever?
从来没有从来没有曾经
永远吗？

17:21.310 --> 17:23.517
Never-ever-never-never,
ever-ever-never!
从来没有从来没有，
永远永远永远！

17:23.620 --> 17:26.517
Never-ever-ever-
ever-ever-ever-ever-ever?!
从来没有永远-
永远永远永远永远？！

17:26.620 --> 17:28.689
Never-ever-never-ever...
永远、永远、永远……

17:31.241 --> 17:32.827
All right, Patrick,
that is enough!
好吧，帕特里克，
这就够了！

17:32.931 --> 17:35.413
Chip, would you mind showing
these two to the door?
Chip，你介意展示一下吗
这两个人到门口了吗？

17:41.068 --> 17:42.068
Thank you, Chip.
谢谢你，奇普。

17:43.379 --> 17:46.379
I guess I'll have to
find a new best friend.
我想我必须
找到一个新的最好的朋友。

17:46.482 --> 17:47.655
Hey, Squidward!
嘿，章鱼哥！

17:47.758 --> 17:48.655
No!
不！

17:48.758 --> 17:49.413
Aw.
噢。

17:49.517 --> 17:50.586
Don't worry, Patrick.
别担心，帕特里克。

17:50.689 --> 17:52.517
We'll get SpongeBob
to come outside,
我们会得到海绵宝宝
来到外面，

17:52.620 --> 17:55.206
and then he'll see there's
nothing to be afraid of.
然后他会看到有
没什么好害怕的。

17:55.310 --> 17:56.724
And that's when
I punch him, right?
就在那时
我打他，对吗？

18:00.551 --> 18:03.551
Look at the jellyfish out here!
看看这里的水母！

18:03.655 --> 18:07.068
Too bad SpongeBob is
missing out on all the fun!
可惜海绵宝宝是
错过了所有的乐趣！

18:09.310 --> 18:11.344
I caught one!
我抓到一只了！

18:16.482 --> 18:19.793
Look at those fools risking
their lives jellyfishing.
看看那些冒着风险的傻瓜
他们的生活就是捕捞水母。

18:19.896 --> 18:22.896
My new hobby is much safer,
isn't it, Chip?
我的新爱好更安全，
不是吗，奇普？

18:23.000 --> 18:24.517
Dust collecting.
集尘。

18:28.586 --> 18:30.000
I think I caught one!
我想我抓到了一个！

18:30.103 --> 18:31.586
We've got to try something else.
我们必须尝试别的东西。

18:32.620 --> 18:34.413
♪ Three cheers
♪ 三声欢呼

18:34.517 --> 18:35.517
♪ On your birthday!
♪ 在你生日那天！

18:35.586 --> 18:37.689
♪ Three cheers for you!
♪ 为你干杯三声！

18:37.793 --> 18:40.586
Now, you've got to blow out
the candles and make a wish.
现在，你必须爆发
蜡烛并许愿。

18:40.689 --> 18:42.551
I don't need the wish, Penny.
我不需要这个愿望，佩妮。

18:42.655 --> 18:45.275
Everything I could ever want
is right here.
我想要的一切
就在这里。

18:45.379 --> 18:47.241
In fact, let's sing our own song
其实我们唱自己的歌吧

18:47.344 --> 18:49.103
about the joy
of staying indoors.
关于喜悦
呆在室内。

18:49.206 --> 18:55.448
♪ I know of a place
where you never get harmed ♪
♪ 我知道一个地方
在那里你永远不会受到伤害♪

18:55.551 --> 19:00.655
♪ A magical place
with magical charms ♪
♪ 一个神奇的地方
带着神奇的魅力♪

19:00.758 --> 19:08.275
♪ Indoors, indoors, indoors!
♪ 室内，室内，室内！

19:08.379 --> 19:09.758
Take it away, Penny!
把它拿走，佩妮！

19:11.310 --> 19:14.620
That Penny has the most
beautiful voice.
那个佩妮拥有最多
美丽的声音。

19:14.724 --> 19:16.413
That is it, SquarePants!
就是这样，方裤！

19:16.517 --> 19:19.344
We're going to find
something that's
so dang fun
我们要找到
那是的东西
太有趣了

19:19.448 --> 19:21.689
that you'll have
to come outside!
你将会拥有
到外面来！

19:22.793 --> 19:24.034
Trampoline!
蹦床！

19:24.137 --> 19:25.137
Ice cream!
冰淇淋！

19:25.241 --> 19:27.241
Underwater surfing!
水下冲浪！

19:27.344 --> 19:28.758
Two ice creams.
两个冰淇淋。

19:28.862 --> 19:29.517
Ferris wheel.
摩天轮。

19:29.620 --> 19:30.793
Still two ice creams!
还是两个冰淇淋！

19:30.896 --> 19:32.931
Clam wrestling.
蛤蜊摔跤。

19:33.034 --> 19:34.655
Washing an old person.
给老人洗澡。

19:34.758 --> 19:36.724
Patrick, that's not fun.
帕特里克，这并不好玩。

19:36.827 --> 19:38.137
It is for me!
这是为了我！

19:43.034 --> 19:44.862
Nothing's working, Patrick.
没有任何作用，帕特里克。

19:44.965 --> 19:45.965
What do we do?
我们该怎么办？

19:46.034 --> 19:48.241
I say we take a bath.
我说我们去洗澡吧。

19:48.344 --> 19:49.344
What...
什么...

19:49.448 --> 19:51.482
Will you get out of here?
你会离开这里吗？

19:53.689 --> 19:55.551
Now, remember... don't jump out
现在，记住...不要跳出来

19:55.655 --> 19:57.068
until I give the signal.
直到我发出信号。

19:57.172 --> 19:58.172
Right.
正确的。

20:00.448 --> 20:03.034
All right, SpongeBob, you win.
好吧，海绵宝宝，你赢了。

20:03.137 --> 20:04.758
Stay inside forever.
永远呆在里面。

20:04.862 --> 20:07.310
Yours is truly the iron will.
你的意志真是钢铁般的。

20:07.413 --> 20:08.758
Now, Pat!
现在，帕特！

20:11.517 --> 20:13.034
Eek! A gorilla!
哎呀！一只大猩猩！

20:13.137 --> 20:15.137
Save me, SpongeBob!
救救我吧，海绵宝宝！

20:19.965 --> 20:20.827
Okay, guys, really.
好吧，伙计们，真的。

20:20.931 --> 20:22.517
This is your
saddest attempt yet.
这是你的
最悲伤的尝试。

20:22.620 --> 20:24.551
Even Chip knows that's Patrick
连奇普都知道那是帕特里克

20:24.655 --> 20:27.344
in the same costume he wore
for Halloween last year.
穿着他穿的同一件衣服
去年万圣节。

20:27.448 --> 20:28.551
No, really!
不，真的！

20:28.655 --> 20:31.310
You've got to come save me.
你一定要来救我。

20:31.413 --> 20:33.758
Hey, Sandy... who's your friend?
嘿，桑迪...谁是你的朋友？

20:33.862 --> 20:36.586
But... but you're
supposed to be in
the gorilla suit.
但是……但是你是
应该在
大猩猩套装。

20:36.689 --> 20:37.827
I am in the gorilla suit.
我穿着大猩猩套装。

20:40.344 --> 20:42.482
I thought I was doing
a pretty good job.
我以为我在做
一份相当不错的工作。

20:42.586 --> 20:45.068
If you're Patrick,
then who's that?
如果你是帕特里克
那么那是谁呢？

20:47.758 --> 20:49.793
A real gorilla!
真正的大猩猩！

20:49.896 --> 20:50.896
Huh?
啊？

21:04.344 --> 21:05.517
No!
不！

21:10.310 --> 21:11.586
Oh, my gosh!
哦，天哪！

21:15.241 --> 21:16.793
This can't be happening!
这不可能发生！

21:22.413 --> 21:26.620
This is exactly the kind
of thing I was talking about!
正是这样的
我正在谈论的事情！

21:26.724 --> 21:28.896
Well, they were asking for it.
嗯，他们是自找的。

21:29.000 --> 21:32.586
It's not like I didn't warn them
about the dangers of outside.
我又不是没有警告过他们
关于外面的危险。

21:32.689 --> 21:35.275
Yes, Chip, I know
they're my two dearest friends
是的，奇普，我知道
他们是我最亲爱的两个朋友

21:35.379 --> 21:36.862
in the whole world,
在全世界，

21:36.965 --> 21:39.724
but I told them I wasn't going
outside no matter what.
但我告诉他们我不会去
外面无论如何。

21:39.827 --> 21:41.689
We can do without
the name-calling,
我们可以不用
谩骂、

21:41.793 --> 21:43.689
thank you very much,
Used Napkin.
非常感谢，
用过的餐巾纸。

21:43.793 --> 21:47.000
I know, Chip, if it was me
out there bagged by an ape,
我知道，奇普，如果是我的话
在那里，被一只猿包裹着，

21:47.103 --> 21:50.724
Patrick and Sandy
would risk anything to save me.
帕特里克和桑迪
愿意冒任何风险来救我。

21:51.793 --> 21:53.862
And I've got to do
the same for them.
我必须做
对他们来说也是如此。

21:53.965 --> 21:58.448
If I don't come back, Chip,
take good care of Gary.
如果我不回来，奇普
照顾好加里。

22:00.172 --> 22:03.034
Well... here I go...
嗯……我这就去……

22:03.137 --> 22:07.241
from the safety of my home
to the outside world.
从我家的安全出发
到外面的世界。

22:21.413 --> 22:23.379
I'm taking my first step.
我正在迈出第一步。

22:23.482 --> 22:25.344
So far so good.
到目前为止，一切都很好。

22:25.448 --> 22:27.482
I think I can do this!
我想我可以做到这一点！

22:28.793 --> 22:29.517
No!
不！

22:29.620 --> 22:30.620
Oh, dear Neptune!
哦，亲爱的海王星！

22:30.724 --> 22:32.275
Get off of me!
放开我！

22:32.379 --> 22:33.448
Get off of me!
放开我！

22:33.551 --> 22:35.068
Chip, help me, help me!
奇普，救救我，救救我！

22:40.517 --> 22:42.000
I'm still alive.
我还活着。

22:43.931 --> 22:44.931
I did it!
我做到了！

22:45.034 --> 22:46.655
I made it outside!
我在外面做到了！

22:46.758 --> 22:48.620
Nothing can stop me now!
现在没有什么可以阻止我了！

22:49.689 --> 22:51.862
Is it too late
to go back inside yet?
是不是太晚了
回去了吗？

22:52.517 --> 22:53.517
It's too late.
太晚了。

22:55.206 --> 22:56.758
Patrick? Sandy?
帕特里克？沙？

22:56.862 --> 22:58.586
Yeah, SpongeBob?
是啊，海绵宝宝？

22:58.689 --> 23:00.655
I'm sorry I caused all this.
我很抱歉这一切都是我造成的。

23:00.758 --> 23:03.689
I'm not scared
of going outside anymore.
我不害怕
不再出去了。

23:03.793 --> 23:05.655
But I'm terrified
of gorillas now.
但我很害怕
现在的大猩猩。

23:05.758 --> 23:08.862
That's okay,
SpongeBob... us, too.
没关系，
海绵宝宝……我们也是。

23:08.965 --> 23:11.827
You know what I don't
understand, though?
你知道我不知道什么
明白吗？

23:11.931 --> 23:12.827
What?
什么？

23:12.931 --> 23:15.068
What's a gorilla
doing underwater?
什么是大猩猩
在水下做？

23:16.482 --> 23:17.931
Uh, well...
呃，好吧...

23:18.034 --> 23:20.517
it's funny you should...
You see, the...
有趣的是你应该...
你看，那...

23:20.620 --> 23:22.103
George, they're onto us!
乔治，他们来找我们了！

23:23.586 --> 23:24.586
Let's get out of here.
我们离开这里吧。

